# The submission ZIP is a build artifact — regenerable from tracked sources
# via build_zip.py, and it embeds the SaaS token, so it should never be
# committed.
sinkhole-playgama.zip

# store-assets/ IS tracked, unlike Endless Core, because GitHub Pages serves
# the cover art from here: it is the og:image for link previews and the site
# favicon. Files a live site serves have to be in the repo. Regenerate with
# make_covers.py rather than editing the PNGs by hand.

# Stale build directory from an earlier packing approach; build_zip.py now
# packs straight from the source files and never creates this.
dist/

# Python bytecode from the tooling scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
